    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期介绍：气味是回忆录里的书签，很多时候就算是忘记了的事情，气味也能让你回想个七七八八。图书馆的油墨味，旧屋子的樟脑丸味，游戏机房的烟油味，这些种种都说不上是好闻的味道，它们却连结着可能早就已经忘记的时间。</span></p><hr><p><span>&nbsp;主播：紧赶慢赶的张十八</span></p><br><blockquote><p><b><span>时间轴</span></b><span>：</span></p></blockquote><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">0:01</a></span></b><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; 夜は短し-Lucky Old Sun</span></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">5:22</a>&nbsp;</span></b><span> &nbsp; Welcome Change&nbsp;- Phum Viphurit</span></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a></span></b><span>&nbsp; 妳迎面走來卻面無表情地離開-</span><span><span>劉ㄚJ</span></span></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a></span></b><span> もうすぐ夜があける &nbsp;- &nbsp;Ikuko Harada</span></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a></span></b><span> &nbsp;misi Ke拋-柯泯薰</span></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2493">41:33</a></span></b><span> &nbsp;Harris Cole - Juli</span></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3054">50:54</a></span></b><span> &nbsp;彷徨い-Fuyuni wakarete</span></p><p><b><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3377">56:17</a></span></b><span> &nbsp;Fazerdaze &nbsp;Winter</span></p><blockquote><p><b><span>Bgm</span></b><span>：</span></p></blockquote><p><span>北国の音楽室の古いピアノ&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>still life</span></p><br>]]></description>
